roid support\n\n# v1.1.8\n- Initial 2.2081 support\n- Removed legacy v8 auth\n\n# v1.1.7\n- Bundles with mismatched GD versions are now hidden\n\n# v1.1.6\n- Made error messages clearer\n\n# v1.1.5\n- Initial 2.2074 support\n- Minor interface refactors\n\n# v1.1.4\n- Added refresh button\n- Added \"Hide Menu Button\" setting\n- Added \"Open Installer\" in Geode settings\n\n# v1.1.3\n- Fixed blocked installation if version detection fails\n\n# v1.1.2\n- Re-added v8 auth\n- Install button now more clearly states its intent\n\n# v1.1.1\n- Fixed multiple issues\n\n# v1.1.0\n- Initial Mega Hack v9 support","created_at":"2024-07-05T17:43:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T17:13:35Z","links":{"community":"https://discord.gg/agMrcTkm9M","homepage":"https://absolllute.com/","source":null}}